{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Robot must find, approach and take an object with checking its properties in short time.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    />\"",
